name: Sprott M
family: Flows
desc: One of J. C. Sprott's 19 simplest chaotic flows (case M) — five terms, one or two nonlinearities.
ref: J. C. Sprott, "Some simple chaotic flows", Phys. Rev. E 50 (1994)
tags: flow, sprott, 3d
dt: 0.02
ic: 0.1 0.1 0.1
camera: 25 20 0 1

param a = 1.7 [1, 2.5]
param b = 1.7 [1, 2.5]

dx = -z
dy = -x^2 - y
dz = a + b*x + y
